sequenceDiagram
  %% Source for 25-search-tool-call-flow.html. Edit this file, then run ./scripts/render-diagrams.py.
  %% Directives: docs in diagrams/README.md (Updating diagrams).
  %% @subtitle Web search interception is off, so LiteLLM returns the model's search call and the client runs the native searxng-search tool itself
  %% @type cloud: TR
  %% @type security: PR
  %% @type external: OAI ENG
  %% @type database: OBS
  actor C as Client / agent
  participant TR as Traefik<br/>TLS + edge limits
  participant LL as LiteLLM proxy<br/>auth · policy · search tools
  participant PR as Presidio<br/>PII masking
  participant OAI as OpenAI<br/>provider model
  participant SX as SearXNG<br/>internal network only
  participant ENG as Search engines<br/>SearXNG defaults
  participant OBS as Telemetry<br/>spend · metrics · spans

  Note over C,LL: 1. the model asks for a search
  C->>TR: POST /v1/chat/completions with a search function tool
  TR->>LL: route by host
  LL->>PR: pre_call: mask PII in the messages
  PR-->>LL: masked messages
  LL->>OAI: call the model with the tool
  OAI-->>LL: tool call: search(query)
  LL->>PR: post_call: mask PII in the output
  PR-->>LL: masked output
  LL-)OBS: spend log, metrics, content-free span
  LL-->>C: tool_calls through Traefik

  Note over C,LL: 2. the client runs the search tool
  C->>TR: POST /v1/search/searxng-search
  TR->>LL: route by host
  alt key invalid or search tool not permitted
    LL--xC: 401 / 403 through Traefik
  else authorized
    Note over LL: Presidio does not mask search queries
    LL->>SX: GET /search?q=…&format=json
    SX->>ENG: query each enabled engine
    ENG-->>SX: result pages
    SX-->>LL: JSON results
    LL-)OBS: spend log, metrics, span
    LL-->>C: results through Traefik
  end

  Note over C,LL: 3. the model answers from the results
  C->>TR: POST /v1/chat/completions with the tool result
  TR->>LL: route by host
  LL->>PR: pre_call: mask PII, including the results
  PR-->>LL: masked messages
  LL->>OAI: call the model
  OAI-->>LL: completion
  LL->>PR: post_call: mask PII in the output
  PR-->>LL: masked output
  LL-)OBS: spend log, metrics, content-free span
  LL-->>TR: response
  TR-->>C: final answer
